    /// <summary>
    /// Which meters each long poll reports, in the order its reply writes them,
    /// and whether it reads them through the library's shared single-meter helper.
    /// </summary>
    /// <remarks>
    /// Read from the handler the dispatcher sends the command to. The distinction
    /// the second half draws is not cosmetic: the shared helper divides a meter
    /// that is not one of the multigame meters by the accounting denomination,
    /// under two of the machine's five meter modes, and every other handler
